ntly cover over 70 percent of  our planet's surface and if given rise  to some of the most extraordinary  species on Earth and in the era of the  soulcash bastiary ocean life has never  been more spectacular  skimming over the waves in great flying  Shoals the tiama feed on swarms of  hovering insects with their elongated  mouths and Keen eyesight these fish are  expert bug catchers perhaps  unsurprisingly the tiama are related to  Flying Fish although tiama are far more  aggressive if a Shoal of these fish is  sufficiently threatened the Swarm  becomes hostile slashing Predators with  their razor-sharp fins in consecutive  flybys  on the Stony beaches of the soulcash  coast the daogon Basques in the seaside  Sun these peculiar mammals possess large  dorsal sails to regulate their  temperature and to attract mates the  dalgon is another relative of the hippo  having taken their semi-aquatic  lifestyle to new extremes their thick  layers of blubber allow them to survive  the frigid depths of the sea floor a  streamlined body makes for a quick  descent to the ocean floor to forage a  trip the dalgon must make daily to  maintain their bulk  one of the greatest Monsters of all  lurks near the surface through six eyes  rising over the choppy waves in search  of prey the archeopty is a large  crustacean that stealthily Treads water  with their petal like limbs keeping  their body hidden until it's time to  strike despite their impressive size  these creatures are most closely related  to current day shrimp when prey lands  close to the archeopty they release a  mucus covered Shard of stone at their  target then drag their fresh meal below  the waves  the soulcash bastiary offers an  inventive interpretation of Life In the  far future yet in addition to being a  speculative Evolution project this  bestiary is also available for DND with  sheets for all the creatures up on the  artist's patreon as well as 3D printing  files made in collaboration with Edge  Miniatures once a